From: ste <ste@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] bootstrap/acl: preserve cross build flags for po helper

The configure run used to prepare generated translation files must use the
same target flags as the element. Without them, an x86-64 bootstrap host can
produce a helper for the wrong ISA during an aarch64 cross build.
---
 elements/bootstrap/acl.bst | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/elements/bootstrap/acl.bst b/elements/bootstrap/acl.bst
--- a/elements/bootstrap/acl.bst
+++ b/elements/bootstrap/acl.bst
@@ -31,7 +31,7 @@ config:
     - |
       mkdir tmp-build
       cd tmp-build
-      ../configure
+      CFLAGS="%{build_flags}" CXXFLAGS="%{build_flags}" ../configure
       cd po
       make
       cd ../..
